Package: neezer-desktop
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: the Neezer project <https://github.com/fnyaker/Neezer>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: pipewire, mesa-vulkan-drivers, fonts-dejavu-core
Suggests: vulkan-radeon, vulkan-intel, nvidia-driver
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fnyaker/Neezer
Description: Neezer — lecteur de musique et de podcasts pour les bureaux Linux
 Lecteur de musique et de podcasts pour les bureaux Linux : interface GPUI,
 lecture gapless et crossfade par PipeWire, MPRIS (les touches multimédia et la
 barre du bureau pilotent le lecteur), cache hors ligne, et transcription locale
 des épisodes sur le GPU via Vulkan.
 .
 Music and podcast player for Linux desktops: GPUI interface, gapless and
 crossfaded playback through PipeWire, MPRIS (the media keys and the desktop's
 player widget drive it), an offline cache, and local podcast transcription on
 the GPU through Vulkan.
 .
 The package installs both binaries: neezer-desktop (the app) and
 neezer-transcribe (the sidecar it starts, whisper.cpp with the Vulkan backend;
 it falls back to the CPU and says why when no Vulkan device is usable).
